{
  "title": "Set Sail! Pro Angler!",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mbox stub\" style=\"border-left-width:8px;margin-bottom:5px;border-left-color:#d6d6d6;position:relative;display:flex;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid #d6d6d6;min-height:32px\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\" style=\"display:table;padding:8px 15px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;image mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-mbox\" style=\"text-align:center;padding-right:15px;display:table-cell;height:100%;vertical-align:middle;width:40px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/e/e8/Baizhi_Sticker_Slice_of_Life_01_08.png/revision/latest?cb=20240703174053\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Baizhi Sticker Slice of Life 01 08\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/e/e8/Baizhi_Sticker_Slice_of_Life_01_08.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/65?cb=20240703174053\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"65\" height=\"65\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Baizhi Sticker Slice of Life 01 08.png\" data-image-key=\"Baizhi_Sticker_Slice_of_Life_01_08.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\" style=\"display:table-cell;vertical-align:middle\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\" style=\"display:block;font-weight:bold\">This <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Article_Stubs\" title=\"Category:Article Stubs\">page</a> is in need of information.</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-mbox\" style=\"display:block\">Can you help out? <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://wutheringwaves.fandom.com/wiki/Set_Sail!_Pro_Angler!?action=edit\">Click here to add more.</a><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text&#95;&#95;comment\" style=\"font-size:small\">MRover dialogue, languages</div></div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-mbox\" title=\"Dismiss\" style=\"color:#bbb;right:0;cursor:pointer;font-size:16px;top:0;transition:all .15s ease-in;position:absolute;padding:2px 7px;font-weight:bold\"></span></div></div></div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-stacked\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Set Sail! Pro Angler!</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tutorial_Quests\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tutorial Quests\">Tutorial</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"chapter\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Event</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Old_Man_and_the_Whale\" title=\"Old Man and the Whale\">Old Man and the Whale</a><br /><b>Chapter</b><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Riccioli_Voyage_Log\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Riccioli Voyage Log\">Riccioli Voyage Log</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"requirement\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Requirements</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><ul><li>Reach <a href=\"/wiki/Union_Level\" title=\"Union Level\">Union Level</a> 14</li><li>Complete <a href=\"/wiki/Main_Quest\" title=\"Main Quest\">Main Quest</a> <i><a href=\"/wiki/Through_the_Sea_Thou_Break\" title=\"Through the Sea Thou Break\">Through the Sea Thou Break</a></i> in <a href=\"/wiki/Chapter_II\" title=\"Chapter II\">Chapter II</a>&#58; Prologue</li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"startLocation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Starting Location</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ragunna_City\" title=\"Ragunna City\">Ragunna City</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"description\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Description</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Sunshine, beach, ocean... and fish! Rinascita, surrounded entirely by the sea, thrives on its love for fishing. A young man named Ishmael will guide you to the Riccioli Islands, a fishing paradise like no other...</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"prev\">Previous Quest</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next Quest</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"prev\">N/A</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Love_in_the_Time_of_Fishing\" title=\"Love in the Time of Fishing\">Love in the Time of Fishing</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRewards\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tCharacters\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"rewards\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"card-list-container\"><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-5\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fame\" title=\"Fame\"><img alt=\"Fame\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Fame.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Fame.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/e/e5/Item_Fame.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20250225212613\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 100</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-5\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Astrite\" title=\"Astrite\"><img alt=\"Astrite\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Astrite.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Astrite.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/1/16/Item_Astrite.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240523021541\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 20</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-4\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advanced_Resonance_Potion\" title=\"Advanced Resonance Potion\"><img alt=\"Advanced Resonance Potion\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Advanced Resonance Potion.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Advanced_Resonance_Potion.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/e/e2/Item_Advanced_Resonance_Potion.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240524152949\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 3</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-3\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shell_Credit\" title=\"Shell Credit\"><img alt=\"Shell Credit\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Shell Credit.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Shell_Credit.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/d/d1/Item_Shell_Credit.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240523132525\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 16,000</span></span></div></span></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"characters\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ahab\" title=\"Ahab\">Ahab</a>, <span class=\"new\" title=\"Coffin (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ29mZmluP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Coffin</span>, <span class=\"new\" title=\"Ishmael (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSXNobWFlbD9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Ishmael</span>, <a href=\"/wiki/Phoebe\" title=\"Phoebe\">Phoebe</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Planck\" title=\"Planck\">Planck</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Rachel\" title=\"Rachel\">Rachel</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Set Sail! Pro Angler!</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Tutorial_Quest\" title=\"Tutorial Quest\">Tutorial Quest</a> that occurs in <a href=\"/wiki/Riccioli_Islands\" title=\"Riccioli Islands\">Riccioli Islands</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Rinascita\" title=\"Rinascita\">Rinascita</a>, [[{{{nation}}}]].\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Summary\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Summary</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Steps\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Steps</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Gameplay_Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gameplay Notes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dialogue</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Other_Languages\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other Languages</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Change_History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Change History</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Summary\">Summary</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>With <span class=\"new\" title=\"Ishmael (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSXNobWFlbD9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Ishmael</span>'s guidance, you manage to find the old captain, <a href=\"/wiki/Ahab\" title=\"Ahab\">Ahab</a> at the dock. Ahab gladly lets you borrow his old Gondola, and you can go fishing at sea with it.<br />After you've recaptured the escaped fish, Ahab suggests you check out the market. To your surprise, <a href=\"/wiki/Phoebe\" title=\"Phoebe\">Phoebe</a> is there too. You find her in a sticky situation because of the locals' fraught history with the <a href=\"/wiki/Order_of_the_Deep\" title=\"Order of the Deep\">Order of the Deep</a>. After you and Ahab help her out, Phoebe reveals she came here searching for <a href=\"/wiki/Cetus_the_Tidebreaker\" title=\"Cetus the Tidebreaker\">Cetus the Tidebreaker</a>. Ahab remarks that you'll run into the beast eventually just by going out fishing.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Steps\">Steps</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ol><li>Find the fisherman</li>\n<li>Find the Gondolier to prepare for the voyage to the Riccioli Islands</li>\n<li>Search for the old captain, \"Ahab\"</li>\n<li>Speak with Planck and get ready to set sail</li>\n<li>Complete fishing requests\n<ol><li>Head to the marked Fishing Spot</li>\n<li>Complete Priority Request \"Ahab's Request: First Test\"Request in event called \"Ahab's Request: Maiden Voyage&#32;&#91;<i><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/sic\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:sic\">sic</a></i>&#93;</li>\n<li>Complete Priority Request \"Ahab's Request: Catch the Big Fish\"Request in event called \"Ahab's Request: Big Catch&#32;&#91;<i><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/sic\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:sic\">sic</a></i>&#93;</li></ol></li>\n<li>With the fish back in the net, go chat with Ahab</li>\n<li>Visit the market in Riccioli Port</li></ol>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gameplay_Notes\">Gameplay Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Complete Vault Underground <a href=\"/wiki/Exploration_Quest\" title=\"Exploration Quest\">Exploration Quest</a> <i><a href=\"/wiki/Silent_as_a_Falling_Leaf\" title=\"Silent as a Falling Leaf\">Silent as a Falling Leaf</a></i> in <a href=\"/wiki/Averardo_Vault\" title=\"Averardo Vault\">Averardo Vault</a>&#58; Act I for the best experience. .</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<dd><div class=\"description-wrapper\"><div class=\"description-title\"><b><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"UI Quest\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/0/0f/UI_Quest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20260501180345\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"UI Quest.png\" data-image-key=\"UI_Quest.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> Quest Description</b></div><hr class=\"description-separator\" /><div class=\"description-content\">Sunshine, beach, ocean... and fish! Rinascita, surrounded entirely by the sea, thrives on its love for fishing. A young man named Ishmael will guide you to the Riccioli Islands, a fishing paradise like no other...</div></div></dd>\n<div class=\"dialogue\">\n<dl><dt>(Talk with the fisherman)</dt>\n<dd><b>Ishmael:</b> Ah, call me <span class=\"new\" title=\"Ishmael (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSXNobWFlbD9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Ishmael</span>. Well, well! The Laureate, I presume? Have you ever tried fishing before?</dd>\n<dd><b>Ishmael:</b> The trick to it is a flexible line and a subtle lure.</dd>\n<dd><b>Ishmael:</b> Fancy trying your hand at deep sea fishing? It's one of Rinascita's many lasting traditions, like the Carnevale.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> Sure, I want to become a pro angler.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> I'd like to give it a try.</dd>\n<dd><b>Ishmael:</b> Wonderful, then I've got a good place for you. <a href=\"/wiki/Riccioli_Islands\" title=\"Riccioli Islands\">Riccioli Islands</a>, north of Ragunna. It's right where the currents of the Stormy Sea meet, drawing in swarms of fish.</dd>\n<dd><b>Ishmael:</b> And if you're alone, angling on a fishing boat would suit you better. A net will just get you tangled up in trouble.</dd>\n<dd><b>Ishmael:</b> Once you reach the islands, go visit an old captain named <a href=\"/wiki/Ahab\" title=\"Ahab\">Ahab</a>. He'll be more than glad to show you the ropes.</dd>\n<dd><b>Ishmael:</b> I've got to make my way back to the islands myself. There's a bot at the harbor that'll take you straight there. Just let the boatman know you're off for some fishing!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Talk with the Gondolier)</dt>\n<dd><b>Gondolier:</b> Are you the one looking for a ride to Riccioli?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> That's me. Let's go.\n<dl><dd><b>Gondolier:</b> Take a seat, and we'll be on our way!</dd></dl></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> I have other matters to attend to. Maybe later.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dd><b>You arrive near the Riccioli Islands on the fisherman's Gondola...</b></dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dd><b>Gondolier:</b> Seeking out old Ahab, are you? He should be at the harbor over there.</dd>\n<dd><b>Gondolier:</b> He's no ordinary man, I tell you that. You'll spot him a mile away.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Head to the designated location)</dt>\n<dd><b>???:</b> Zzz... Zzz...</dd>\n<dd><b>???:</b> Huh? Hmm... All right, cut it out...</dd>\n<dd><b>???:</b> Oh! Ahoy! A fish! We have a bite!</dd>\n<dd><b>???:</b> Well, don't just stand there, <span>(&#8205;&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"laddie\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">laddie</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">Text for male Rover</span></span>&#8205;/<wbr />&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"missy\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">missy</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">Text for female Rover</span></span>&#8205;&#8205;)</span>! Gimme a hand with this thing!</dd>\n<dd><b>???:</b> Oh, wait! Easy does it...</dd>\n<dd><b>???:</b> That's gotta be one hefty fish...</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Too bad it got away...\n<dl><dd><b>???:</b> A big fella like that? He won't be gettin' away from me, just a matter of time, no bother at all.</dd></dl></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Are you all right?\n<dl><dd><b>???:</b> Oh, That? Pah, that was nothing. Back in me youth, I could hunt a whale for a whole day, I could!</dd></dl></dd>\n<dd><b>???:</b> You must be that young'un Ishmael mentioned.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Yes, I'm here to become a pro fisher.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Yes, I'm hre to try deep sea fishing.</dd>\n<dd><b>Ahab:</b> Aye, good! You've come to the right place. The name's <a href=\"/wiki/Ahab\" title=\"Ahab\">Ahab</a>, and I've been tied to this harbor longer than most.</dd>\n<dd><b>Ahab:</b> That octopus merchant over there is <a href=\"/wiki/Planck\" title=\"Planck\">Planck</a>. It has all you need, from fishing gear to boat repairs.</dd>\n<dd><b>Ahab:</b> But... I see you don't have a boat. We can fix that! You can use mine!</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> A Gondola?</dd>\n<dd><b>Ahab:</b> The ones we use here for fishing are different from what you'll find in the city. We treat 'em like family—live and die together, we do.</dd>\n<dd><b>Ahab:</b> She's called <a href=\"/wiki/Rachel\" title=\"Rachel\">Rachel</a>. Gettin' on in years, but she's still got some fire in her.</dd>\n<dd><b>Ahab:</b> Since I retired, it's been a while since she and I crashed some waves. I reckon she misses the old fishing days as much as I do.</dd>\n<dd><b>Ahab:</b> Well, now that we've shared a bit of fishing, I'd say we've forged a bond, eh?</dd>\n<dd><b>Ahab:</b> What do you say we chase that big fella that gave us the slip? Let's head straight out to sea!</dd>\n<dd><b>Ahab:</b> I'd like to see what kind of fish dares to run away from old Ahab!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Speak with Ahab)</dt>\n<dd><b>Ahab:</b> Ahoy! That was some mighty fine sailing back there!</dd>\n<dd><b>Ahab:</b> You picked it up quickly. Good, good!</dd>\n<dd><b>Ahab:</b> Ah, don't forget to stop by the market when ye've got time to spare.</dd>\n<dd><b>Ahab:</b> Minding the helm is only half the battle. You've got to know how to trade, too!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<p>(Head to the designated location)\n</p>\n<dl><dd><b>Seafood Dealer:</b> ...Oi, the Order's got no authority here. Now, bugger off, will ya.</dd>\n<dd><b>Young Fisherman:</b> Come on, Mr. Coffin. Didn't she just help you fish your Echo...</dd>\n<dd><b>Seafood Dealer:</b> Hell if I know what she's playin' at!</dd>\n<dd><b>Old Lady:</b> Oh, pipe down, Coffin. The wee lassie was just asking you for some directions, for Imperator's sake.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Phoebe\" title=\"Phoebe\">Phoebe</a>?</dd>\n<dd><b>Phoebe:</b> I'm sorry...</dd>\n<dd><b>Phoebe:</b> I'm only look for <a href=\"/wiki/Cetus_the_Tidebreaker\" title=\"Cetus the Tidebreaker\">Cetus the Tidebreaker</a>. They were injured in Ragunna...</dd>\n<dd><b>Old Lady:</b> Cetus the Tidebreaker, you say? Well...</dd>\n<dd><b>Coffin:</b> The Order is not welcome around these parts! Yer hear me?</dd>\n<dd><b>Young Fisherman:</b> Hey, look. Isn't that the Resonator who showed up in Ragunna a while back? The Laureate...</dd>\n<dd><b>Ahab:</b> That's enough of that!</dd>\n<dd><b>Ahab:</b> The Order's left us alone for years. If they really wanted to meddle in our affairs now, you think they'd just send one little girl?</dd>\n<dd><b>Ahab:</b> We owe our treade to the blessings of Cetus the Tidebreaker and these very seas. Ye're tellin' me we can't accept a wee lass in an acolyte hat?</dd>\n<dd><b>Ahab:</b> Besides, do you really think she's helping you out for some devious reason? Being ungrateful isn't our way, is it?</dd>\n<dd><b>Coffin:</b> But Ahab...</dd>\n<dd><b>Ahab:</b> Right then, that's enough of that. Business has been hard as it is lately. Break it up, folks...</dd>\n<dd><b>Ahab:</b> If ye've got more complaints, toss 'em my way. Happy now? Off you go.</dd>\n<dd><b>Phoebe:</b> Thank you.</dd>\n<dd><b>Phoebe:</b> I'm here because I want to talk to the villagers about the Tidebreaker. No one has seen them since the <a href=\"/wiki/Carnevale\" title=\"Carnevale\">Carnevale</a>...</dd>\n<dd><b>Ahab:</b> Friend of yours, <span>(&#8205;&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"laddie\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">laddie</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">Text for male Rover</span></span>&#8205;/<wbr />&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"missy\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">missy</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">Text for female Rover</span></span>&#8205;&#8205;)</span>?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Yeah, we go way back.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> We're acquainted, yes.</dd>\n<dd><b>Ahab:</b> All right, then. But know this—the Order's let these islands drift without a guide, so the folk around here aren't too keen on seeing someone wearin' that kind of hat wanderin' about.</dd>\n<dd><b>Phoebe:</b> My hat? Err...</dd>\n<dd><b>Ahab:</b> Anyway, just say ye're here on personal business and ye'll be fine. Now, I hear ye're lookin' for Cetus the Tidebreaker. Well, lucky you, 'cause so am I.</dd>\n<dd><b>Phoebe:</b> Yes! The Tidebreaker showed unnatural signs during the Carnevale not long ago. I think I sensed their pain and anger...</dd>\n<dd><b>Ahab:</b> Well, sail around in these waters and ye're bound to run into it, sooner or later. But if you want the simple way... See that lighthouse down yonder?</dd>\n<dd><b>Ahab:</b> There are four of 'em across Riccioli Islands. As long as their lights are on, the Tidebreaker will answer our pleas as gently as ever.</dd>\n<dd><b>Ahab:</b> Three of them went dark when the Tidebreaker vanished. Getting them lit again should do the trick.</dd>\n<dd><b>Ahab:</b> You know what? Why don't you take Miss White hat here on a wee boat ride, (&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Rover\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Rover</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">The player's chosen name for Rover</span></span>&#8205;)?</dd>\n<dd><b>Phoebe:</b> A boat ride?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> We're going fishing!</dd>\n<dd><b>Phoebe:</b> W-what? I've only ever read about Riccioli Islands' fishing trade in the Order's library before, but I've never actually fished on the sea...</dd>\n<dd><b>Ahab:</b> How do you expect the sea to answer yer calls if you don't embrace it yerself?</dd>\n<dd><b>Ahab:</b> Oh, and hold onto yer \"hat\" during the ride. If anything else comes up, just come find me.</dd>\n<dd><b>Phoebe:</b> What did he mean by that, (&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed wuwa-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Rover\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Rover</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">The player's chosen name for Rover</span></span>&#8205;)?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Just be yourself!</dd>\n<dd><b>Phoebe:</b> I see...</dd>\n<dd><b>Phoebe:</b> Then I'll help however I can with catching fish while we locate the Tidebreaker!</dd>\n<dt>(Quest Complete)</dt></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table alternating-colors-table\"><tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji EN Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji EN Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_EN_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/f/f5/Emoji_EN_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221541\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;English</b></td><td>Set Sail! Pro Angler!</td></tr><tr><td style=\"line-height:1em\"><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji ZHS Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji ZHS Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_ZHS_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/5/5f/Emoji_ZHS_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221618\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;Chinese <abbr title=\"Simplified\"><small>(S)</small></abbr></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hans\">出发！成为捕鱼达人！</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"line-height:1em\"><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji ZHT Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji ZHT Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_ZHT_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/0/02/Emoji_ZHT_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221733\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;Chinese <abbr title=\"Traditional\"><small>(T)</small></abbr></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">出發！成為捕魚達人！</span></td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji JA Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji JA Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_JA_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/8/84/Emoji_JA_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221804\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;Japanese</b></td><td><span lang=\"ja\">出航！魚捕りの達人を目指せ！</span></td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji KO Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji KO Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_KO_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/5/5d/Emoji_KO_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221837\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;Korean</b></td><td><span lang=\"ko\">출발</span>! <span lang=\"ko\">낚시의</span> <span lang=\"ko\">달인이</span> <span lang=\"ko\">되어라</span>!</td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji FR Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji FR Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_FR_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/c/c6/Emoji_FR_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221935\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;French</b></td><td>Allons-y, Pêcheur pro&#160;!</td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji DE Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji DE Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_DE_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/3/3b/Emoji_DE_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221959\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;German</b></td><td>Setz die Segel! Werde Angelprofi!</td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji ES Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji ES Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_ES_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/d/d2/Emoji_ES_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221908\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;Spanish</b></td><td>¡Zarpa, pescador profesional!</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Change_History\">Change History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"change-history\"><div class=\"change-history-header\"><div>Released in <b><a href=\"/wi